{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28832","headline":"闻薛先辈陪大夫看早梅因寄 · 许浑","name":"闻薛先辈陪大夫看早梅因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涧梅寒正发，莫信笛中吹。\n素艳雪凝树，清香风满枝。\n折惊山鸟散，携任野蜂随。\n今日从公醉，何人倒接䍦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}